cd elearning - to enter the folder or else you will run into error while running npm run dev 
npm run dev - to start the server
open your browser and navigate to localhost:3000
node --env-file=.env.local server/index.mjs - to start the api course server 

do not forget to 
git add .
git commit -m "message pull"
git push origin main"or your branch name"


Only run this if you made changes to the curriculum.json - That is the database for the elearning web containing the course 
`node --env-file=.env.local scripts/seed-curriculum.mjs`  